---
/** Home testimonials — static 3×2 grid of 6 cards. */
---

<section class="section container" style="padding-top: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px)">
  <p class="eyebrow testi__eyebrow reveal">Proven Success</p>
  <div class="testi__track reveal">
    <article class="testi-card">
      <div class="testi-card__top">
        <img src="/assets/img/t-suranya.webp" alt="Suranya Aiyar" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <div class="testi-card__name">Suranya Aiyar</div>
          <div class="testi-card__role">CEO, Bhagyam Arts &amp; Aesthetic</div>
          <a class="testi-card__social" href="https://www.facebook.com/suranya.aiyar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook <span class="testi-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="testi-card__quote">"Studio 1947 delivered exceptional promotional designs for our cultural programmes. Their unique emphasis on visual storytelling added a fascinating, artistic layer to our work that we hadn't seen before".</p>
    </article>

    <article class="testi-card">
      <div class="testi-card__top">
        <img src="/assets/img/t-sharda.webp" alt="Sharda Mohanty" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <div class="testi-card__name">Sharda Mohanty</div>
          <div class="testi-card__role">CEO, AIcrowd</div>
          <a class="testi-card__social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sharada-prasanna-mohanty-752003189/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn <span class="testi-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="testi-card__quote">"Working with the team has been a treat. They did an amazing job simplifying technical jargon into thoughtful illustrations, making our challenging concepts genuinely engaging and effective for our audience."</p>
    </article>

    <article class="testi-card">
      <div class="testi-card__top">
        <img src="/assets/img/t-mandvi.webp" alt="Mandvi Kulshreshtha" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <div class="testi-card__name">Mandvi Kulshreshtha</div>
          <div class="testi-card__role">Senior Program Advisor, Friedrich-Ebert-Stiftung, India</div>
          <a class="testi-card__social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mandvi-kulshreshtha-1545b217/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn <span class="testi-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="testi-card__quote">"As a development organization, we often struggle to make abstract research accessible. Studio 1947 translated our complex vision into visually meaningful products that made our findings exciting and easy to understand."</p>
    </article>

    <article class="testi-card">
      <div class="testi-card__top">
        <img src="/assets/img/t-vikram.webp" alt="Vikram Buragohain" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <div class="testi-card__name">Vikram Buragohain</div>
          <div class="testi-card__role">Jan Sahas Foundation</div>
          <a class="testi-card__social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vikram-buragohain-31545225/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn <span class="testi-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="testi-card__quote">"We onboarded Studio 1947 for the development of the JSSES website, and despite it being our first collaboration, the entire process was seamless. The team was highly responsive, implementing every piece of feedback and requested change promptly and efficiently."</p>
    </article>

    <article class="testi-card">
      <div class="testi-card__top">
        <img src="/assets/img/t-manisha.webp" alt="Manisha Pande" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <div class="testi-card__name">Manisha Pande</div>
          <div class="testi-card__role">Village Ways</div>
          <a class="testi-card__social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/manisha-pande-65092415/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn <span class="testi-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="testi-card__quote">"Studio 1947 impressed us with their creative digital marketing ideas and innovative promotional designs. They were particularly good at working with our partner villages in the Sundarbans. Professional, reliable, and highly recommended."</p>
    </article>

    <article class="testi-card">
      <div class="testi-card__top">
        <img src="/assets/img/t-rishi.webp" alt="Rishi Agarwal" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <div class="testi-card__name">Rishi Agarwal</div>
          <div class="testi-card__role">Convener, Walking Project</div>
          <a class="testi-card__social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rishiaggarwaal/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn <span class="testi-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="testi-card__quote">"At Walking Project we were happy to engage with Studio 1947 in finding solutions to fund raising through improved digital marketing and presence. The team was thoughtful and involved and we could do a synthesis of what we understood best about our domain combined with their understanding of the online medium and audience behaviour."</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
